	"Fish.CopperFlounder.Desc": "A flat fish with a metallic rusty shine. It buries itself in the river bottom, often fooling panners into thinking they found copper.",
	"Fish.RiverUnicorn.Name": "River Unicorn",
	"Fish.RiverUnicorn.Desc": "A whimsical fish with a spiral horn on its head. It uses the tusk to spar with friends and break open geodes.",
	"Fish.FrigidGlower.Name": "Frigid Glower",
	"Fish.FrigidGlower.Desc": "A fish that always looks like it disapproves of everything. It stares at you judgmentally in the freezing waters without ever being impressed.",
	"Fish.PineconePerch.Name": "Pinecone Perch",
	"Fish.PineconePerch.Desc": "Its scales have hardened as strong as wood. It has a bright red crest and blends in with the fallen holly berries on the riverbanks.",
	"Fish.GlacialRibbon.Name": "Glacial Ribbon",
	"Fish.GlacialRibbon.Desc": "An elegant fish that looks like it is made of living ice. It quietly swims through the water, leaving a frost trail behind it.",
	"Fish.MiniOrca.Name": "Mini Orca",
	"Fish.MiniOrca.Desc": " A tiny freshwater orca. Don't ask questions, just go with it.",
	
